1. https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/59237 (**landed in WPT repo**)
2. https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/59915 (from https://crrev.com/c/7765209)
3. https://crrev.com/c/7787494 (Waiting on Chromium infra to create a PR)
4. https://crrev.com/c/7842790 (Waiting on Chromium infra to create a PR)

**Replacement PR for 2-4 above: https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/59955**

